<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST - AssiDoman Q1 profit 427 mln skr.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - AssiDoman Q1 profit 427 mln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group AssiDoman AB is expected to post a profit of 427 million crowns after financial items for the first quarter of 1997, a Reuter poll of analysts showed on Friday.</p>
<p>The figure compares to a profit of 827 million crowns in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>The full year profit for 1997 is expected to reach 2.38 billion crowns, which would be a 39 percent rise over 1996 profits, the poll showed.</p>
<p>AssiDoman is due to post its first quarter result on May 13. Profit after fin items  average    range	number of analysts</p>
<p>(Million skr)</p>
<p>Q1 1997			 427	 350-539		 10</p>
<p>Full year 1997	     2,377     1,900-2,720	     9</p>
<p>Full year 1998	     3,403     2,924-3,820	     8</p>
<p>-- Joel Dahlberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1007</p>
</text>
